#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:17
msgid "Overview of Breaking Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:19
msgid ""
"Welcome to version 11.0.  This a major release and therefore contains "
"breaking changes.  Below is a complete list of those such changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:22
msgid "Built-in set of \"Common\" Languages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:24
msgid ""
"The default `highlight.min.js` build **removes** a few less popular grammars:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:26
msgid "apache"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:27
msgid "http"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:28
msgid "nginx"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:29
msgid "properties"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:30
msgid "coffeescript"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:32
msgid "If you need any of these, you can always create a custom build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:34
msgid "Ref: https://github.com/highlightjs/highlight.js/issues/2848"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:37
msgid "Language Files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:39
msgid ""
"This would matter if you are requiring any of these files directly (via Node."
"js or CDN)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:41
msgid "`htmlbars` has been removed. Use `handlebars` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:42
msgid "`c-like` has been removed. Use `c`, `cpp`, or `arduino`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:43
msgid ""
"`sql_more` has been removed. Use `sql` instead or a more specific 3rd party "
"grammar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:46
msgid "Language Aliases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:48
msgid "This would matter if you are using these aliases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:50
msgid ""
"`php3`,`php4`,`php5`, `php6`, `php7`, and `php8` have been removed. Use "
"`php` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:51
msgid "`zsh` has been removed. Use `sh` or `bash` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:52
msgid ""
"`freepascal`, `lazarus`, `lpr`, and `lpm` removed. Use `delphi` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:54
msgid ""
"You can of course re-register any of these aliases easily if necessary. For "
"example to restore the PHP aliases:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:56
msgid ""
"hljs.registerAliases([\"php3\",\"php4\",\"php5\",\"php6\",\"php7\",\"php8\"],"
"{ languageName: \"php\" })\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:60
msgid "Styles and CSS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:62
msgid ""
"The default padding on `.hljs` element has been increased and is now `1em` "
"(it was `0.5em` previously). If your design depends on the smaller spacing "
"you may need to update your CSS to override."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:63
msgid ""
"`schoolbook` no longer has a custom lined background, it is solid color "
"now.  The old image and CSS can be found in the [10-stable branch](https://"
"github.com/highlightjs/highlight.js/tree/10-stable/src/styles) if you wish "
"to manually copy it into your project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:64
msgid ""
"`github` includes significant changes to more properly match modern GitHub "
"syntax highlighting. If you desire the old theme you can manually copy it "
"into your project from the [10-stable branch](https://github.com/highlightjs/"
"highlight.js/tree/10-stable/src/styles)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:65
msgid ""
"`github-gist` has been removed in favor of `github` as GitHub and GitHub "
"Gist have converged. If you desire the theme you can manually copy it into "
"your project from the [10-stable branch](https://github.com/highlightjs/"
"highlight.js/tree/10-stable/src/styles)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:66
msgid ""
"The `.hljs` CSS selector is now further scoped.  It now targets `code.hljs` "
"(inline code) and `pre code.hljs` (code blocks). If you are using a "
"different element you may need to update your CSS to reapply some styling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:67
msgid ""
"All [Base16 themes](https://github.com/highlightjs/base16-highlightjs) now "
"live in the `styles/base16` directory - this means some CSS files have "
"moved.  Please confirm themes you use reference the new locations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:70
msgid "Grammar Scopes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:72
msgid ""
"`.meta-string` removed/deprecated.  Use `.meta .string` (a nested scope) "
"instead. See [meta-keyword][]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:73
msgid ""
"`.meta-keyword` removed/deprecated.  Use `.meta .keyword` (a nested scope) "
"instead. See [meta-keyword][]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:75
msgid "Behavioral changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:77
msgid ""
"`after:highlightElement` plugin callback is now fired *after* the DOM has "
"been updated, not before."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:79
msgid "API changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:81
msgid ""
"The option `ignoreIllegals` is now `true` by default (for `highlight()`). "
"Previously it was `false`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:82
msgid ""
"The `highlight(language,code, ...args)` API no longer accepts `continuation` "
"as a 4th argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:83
msgid ""
"The `highlight(language,code, ...args)` API is deprecated (to be removed in "
"12.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:85
msgid ""
"The new call signature is `highlight(code, {options})`. ([see docs](https://"
"highlightjs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#highlight))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:87
msgid "Code using the old API:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:89
msgid ""
"// highlight(language, code, ignoreIllegals, continuation)\n"
"highlight(\"javascript\", \"var a = 5;\", true)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:93
msgid "...would be upgraded to the newer API as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:95
msgid ""
"// highlight(code, {language, ignoreIllegals})\n"
"highlight(\"var a = 5;\", {language: \"javascript\", ignoreIllegals: true})\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:100
msgid ""
"The new API purposely does not support `continuation` as this is only "
"intended for internal library usage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:102
msgid "`initHighlighting()` is deprecated (to be removed in 12.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:103
msgid "`initHighlightingOnLoad()` is deprecated (to be removed in 12.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:105
msgid ""
"**Use `highlightAll()` instead.** ([see docs](https://highlightjs."
"readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#highlight-all)) The old functions are now "
"simply aliases of `highlightAll()`. The new function may be called before or "
"after the DOM is loaded and should do the correct thing in all cases, "
"replacing the need for the previous individual functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:107
msgid ""
"Note: `highlightAll()` does not guard against calling itself repeatedly as "
"the previous functions did. Your code should be careful to avoid doing this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:109
msgid "`highlightBlock()` is deprecated (to be removed in 12.0)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:111
msgid ""
"**Use `highlightElement()` instead.** ([see docs](https://highlightjs."
"readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#highlight-element)) This is merely a "
"naming change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:113
msgid ""
"Note: The object literal passed to the `before:highlightElement` callback "
"now passes the element in the `el` key vs the `block` key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:115
msgid "Changes to Result Data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:117
msgid "`highlightAuto()`'s `second_best` key has been renamed to `secondBest`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:118
msgid ""
"`highlightElement()`'s result now no longer includes a `re` key. Use the "
"`relevance` key now."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:119
msgid ""
"`highlight()` renames some result keys to more clearly mark them as private: "
"`_top`, `_emitter`, and `_illegalBy`. You should not depend on these keys as "
"they are subject to change at any time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:120
msgid ""
"The `relevance` key returned by `highlight()` is no longer guaranteed to be "
"an even integer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:121
msgid ""
"`highlightElement` now always tags blocks with a consistent `language-"
"[name]` class"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:123
msgid ""
"This behavior was inconsistent before.  Sometimes `[name]` class would be "
"added, sometimes the alias name would be added, something no class would be "
"added.  now `language-[name]` is always added. This also affects sublanguage "
"`span` tags which now also include the `language-` prefix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:125
msgid "Feature Removal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:127
msgid ""
"HTML auto-passthru is now no longer included in core.  Use a plugin instead. "
"For a possible plugin please see [#2889](https://github.com/highlightjs/"
"highlight.js/issues/2889)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:129
msgid "An example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:131
msgid ""
"<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">\n"
"var a = 4;\n"
"<span class=\"yellow\">var a = 4;</span>\n"
"</code></pre>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:138
msgid ""
"Unescaped HTML like this will now be ignored (stripped before highlighting) "
"and a warning will be logged to the console.  All HTML to be highlighted "
"should be properly escaped to avoid potential HTML/JS injection attacks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:140
msgid "`fixMarkup` has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:142
msgid ""
"This function was deprecated in v10.2.  It is not our goal to provide random "
"string utilities. You may need to provide your own replacement [Ref: #2534]"
"(https://github.com/highlightjs/highlight.js/issues/2634)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:144
msgid "`CSS_NUMBER_MODE` has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:146
msgid ""
"This rule was too broad for bring inclusion in core and has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:148
msgid "`lexemes` mode attribute has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:150
msgid "Use the new `keywords.$pattern` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:152
msgid "Before:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:154
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  keywords: \"do.it start.now begin.later end.immediately\"\n"
"  lexemes: /[a-z.]+/\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:161
msgid "After:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:163
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  keywords: {\n"
"    $pattern: /[a-z.]+/\n"
"    keyword: \"do.it start.now begin.later end.immediately\",\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:172
msgid ""
"This may required converting your `keywords` key into an object if it's not "
"already (as shown above)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:174
msgid "`endSameAsBegin` mode attribute has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:176
msgid "Use the new `END_SAME_AS_BEGIN` mode rule/function instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:178
msgid "`useBR` configuration has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:180
msgid ""
"This configuration option was deprecated in v10.1. Use a plugin or "
"preferably simply CSS `white-space: pre`. [Ref: #2559](https://github.com/"
"highlightjs/highlight.js/issues/2559)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:183
msgid "`tabReplace` configuration has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:185
msgid ""
"This configuration option was deprecated in v10.5. Use a plugin or pre-"
"render content instead with desired spacing. [Ref: #2874](https://github.com/"
"highlightjs/highlight.js/issues/2874)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:191
msgid "Small Things"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../upgrade-11.md:193
msgid ""
"The `regex` utility `join` has been renamed to "
"`_eitherRewriteBackreferences` (this has always been intended for internal "
"use only)"
msgstr ""

